  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'><div>This data set shows utility points that provide services for:\n<ul>\n<li>power<br /></li>\n<li>water<br /></li>\n<li>communications<br /></li>\n<li>heating fuel<br /></li>\n</ul>\n\nThey include:\n<ul>\n<li>fibre optic stations<br /></li>\n<li>hydro stations<br /></li>\n<li>lock pumping stations<br /></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div> <strong>Additional Documentation<br /></strong> </div><div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Utility%20Site%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Utility Site - Data Description (PDF)</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Utility Site - Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Utility Site - Documentation (Word)</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div> <strong>Status<br /> </strong> </div>\n<div>Required: data needs to be generated or updated<br /> </div>\n<div> <br /> </div>\n\n<div> <strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency<br /> </strong> </div>\n<div>Not planned: there are no plans to update the data</div><br /> \n\n<div> <strong>Contact<br /> </strong> </div>\n<div>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - Geospatial Ontario, <a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>geospatial@ontario.ca </a> </div></div></div></span>"
